# Lunora endpoint for the browser client. Rsbuild statically replaces
# `import.meta.env.PUBLIC_LUNORA_URL` at dev / build time.
#
# Leave it unset for local dev: the browser uses the page origin, and
# `rsbuild dev` proxies `/_lunora/*` to the Worker. Set it to point the client
# at a deployed Worker:
#
# PUBLIC_LUNORA_URL=https://my-app.example.workers.dev
